{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f0ab3fd345fc7efff705b8cae248edb4d928253ab03c546cf440a8fc1379d0bc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:717d8d1a905f596069968e37ed0c68b89908e034e82d3357d7a2e1fcb9298097",
      "text": "制作人。现在方便说话吗？\n我有话想告诉您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2a2eabde4f35c9aac29e6ca2882119f4609afbb3b55ea9ff3d96979cda7f4a4",
      "text": "好的，\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5248e45bab0e5371f6bcae6b19e34455261ab831e75a1a7c0fdaf54f7b9d3af",
      "text": "时装秀那次，\n非常感谢您的建议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1aa1f0eec7eabe885b4354fe3dc45cf2f7b769fd7135972e006ce8394f8a9e9",
      "text": "触摸了布料之后，\n我对服装的理解更加深刻了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419f7780057c505924ac21af8afa776fb5635b82902f03c6c37a7208d0c26c3e",
      "text": "因为重量不同，飘动的形态也会改变等等，\n许多事情光凭肉眼是无法了解的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da7d661d1d7d57a5f29e26eb90fb712fb534eec28754f7079679b2902072e6a",
      "text": "这让我得以重新注意布料的摆动，\n我想这也很好地运用到了优美的举止中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1327d8217d0df5900062a657526946c33278e774b6f77be616f65eaf1339c8f4",
      "text": "多亏如此，我切实感受到了一点收获。\n再次向您表示感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_b:2_4_028_01_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3375b5a0d6c388509842aa4f5b8ba9b396354a570534f7d6c6cc252ffd8894c7",
      "text": "那么，下一份工作也请多多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
